**Critical Alerts** (Page someone):
- [ ] Service down > 1 minute
- [ ] Error rate > 5%
- [ ] Latency P95 > 1s

**Warning Alerts** (Notify only):
- [ ] CPU > 80% for 5 minutes
- [ ] Memory > 90%
- [ ] Disk > 85%

